Tester box 58844 (thread 51914): after „რა გჭირდება ჩემზე იცოდე…?“ the owner answered „ბათუმში სასტუმრო მაქვს“, and the day's question about a contact came in that reply. The owner's previous line in the conversation (last 30 minutes) is read too, before the day's question is taken.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
---
